        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "The Periodic Table - Overview and Framework",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The periodic table is the single most compressed encoding of matter's behavior: 118 elements arranged\nso that **every column shares a chemical personality** and **every row shares a quantum shell**."
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#003",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:periodic-table:00-overview, git-history:periodic-table:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "periodic-table/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "periodic-table/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:periodic-table:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "periodic-table",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "periodic-table",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "The Periodic Table - Overview and Framework",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n                          THE PERIODIC TABLE — BLOCK MAP\n ┌────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────┐\n │ s  │                                                                        │       p-block      │\n │    │                         d-block (transition metals)                   │                    │\n │blk │                                                                        │                    │\n ├────┼────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬─┴──┬──┬──┬──┬──┬────┤\n │ 1  │ H  │                                                                │ He │\n ├────┼────┤                                                                ├────┼──┼──┼──┼──┼────┤\n │ 2  │Li  │Be                                                              │ B  │C │N │O │F │Ne  │\n ├────┼────┤                                                                ├────┼──┼──┼──┼──┼────┤\n │ 3  │Na  │Mg                  Sc Ti V  Cr Mn Fe Co Ni Cu Zn              │ Al │Si│P │S │Cl│Ar  │\n ├────┼────┤                                                                ├────┼──┼──┼──┼──┼────┤\n │ 4  │K   │Ca                  Y  Zr Nb Mo Tc Ru Rh Pd Ag Cd             │ In │Sn│Sb│Te│I │Xe  │\n ├────┼────┤                                                                ├────┼──┼──┼──┼──┼────┤\n │ 5  │Rb  │Sr                  Hf Ta W  Re Os Ir Pt Au Hg                │ Tl │Pb│Bi│Po│At│Rn  │\n ├────┼────┤                                                                ├────┼──┼──┼──┼──┼────┤\n │ 6  │Cs  │Ba  ──lanthanides── (La-Lu)                                   │ Nh │Fl│Mc│Lv│Ts│Og  │\n ├────┼────┤                                                                └────┴──┴──┴──┴──┴────┘\n │ 7  │Fr  │Ra  ──actinides──── (Ac-Lr)\n └────┴────┘\n         │\n         └── f-block (lanthanides + actinides, usually pulled below)"
    },
    {
