        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "The Periodic Table - Overview and Framework",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "| Mendeleev's name | Predicted (1871) | Element discovered | Year |\n|-----------------|-----------------|-------------------|------|\n| eka-boron | At. wt ~44, metallic oxide X₂O₃ | Scandium (Sc, Z=21) | 1879 |\n| eka-aluminium | At. wt ~68, liquid metal | Gallium (Ga, Z=31) | 1875 |\n| eka-silicon | At. wt ~72, semiconductor | Germanium (Ge, Z=32) | 1886 |"
    },
